Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:25.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:28.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:35.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:49.41,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.86,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:56.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:59.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:03.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:06.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:16.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:22.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:29.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:34.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:38.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:39.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:40.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:43.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:24.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算隱瞞也是沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:28.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼我都全部知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:35.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這並非不可思議　因為　我是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:40.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛著你的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:45.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　朝向這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:50.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:52.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:56.95,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直　永遠不變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:23:03.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在珠穆朗瑪峰　向世界進行　絕對宣言！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:08.41,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之　接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.41,0:23:12.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,2人　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.81,0:23:15.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:19.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是　希望大吉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:23.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在聖·伯多祿　發誓　愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:26.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對宣言！！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  要開早會了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石同學  三宮同學  野上同學因為家裡有事  今天請假
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  真無趣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}那麼開始點名
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}淺川君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得我想把新練就的必殺技展示給她看的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}池野同學
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}上野君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家裡的事到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}遠藤同學
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(760,600)\fad(500,500)}「平平凡凡！被束縛的Children」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(660,570)\fad(500,500)}7th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東北兩公里  以時速約五十公里朝西南偏南方向移動中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  首先對付這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就上了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動V字斬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(603,660)}Psychic
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  左邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一如往常  好強的力量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要大意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還有殘餘敵軍的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西北偏北方向一公里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點解決掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children移動了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雜兵果然不是The Children的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  差不多該開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型ECM  啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一帶霧好濃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人在哪邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在探索一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法透視
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被妨礙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時先撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬移不能?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就由我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終止  終止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上終止新型ECM的測試
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動金剛飛拳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(581,660)}Psychic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  骨頭沒有斷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是擦傷了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不疼  不疼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  我不是叫你停手了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生你也真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道要做ECM的測試就早說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果事前得知測試內容的話  就得不出正確結果了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有其他事瞞著我們的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有ECM這事而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰你也說點什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…ECM是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是ECM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ESP Counter Measure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,譯成日語就是「超能力對抗裝置」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是超能力妨礙裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到連LV7的超能力都會失效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上課的時候不是講過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡著了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個新型ECM能夠發出強大的數位念波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使一切超能力無效化
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與舊款相比資料數據更加齊全  效率也大幅提升
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過體積過大是它的美中不足
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傷沒大礙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有我能做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管什麼  儘管說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  能夠如常使用超能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要適可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒關係的  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為B.A.B.E.L的局長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說是間接的  但我確實傷害到了超能力者們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是罪有應得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:06:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用留情  用那LV7的力量盡情施放於我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來  再來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解恨之前儘管發洩吧  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉  一大早就進行不利於教育的懲罰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  ECM是對抗我們超能力者的兵器吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼B.A.B.E.L要協助開發這種東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是那種東西面世了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就無法自由地使用超能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你們認為我們的力量消除掉更好點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,單靠限制器的話有所不安？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是沒有人抑制我們的話  很可怕對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  不是這樣的  我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「當然那樣的話確實是輕鬆點」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「不會被人看穿內心  不會被非法入侵  不會被按進牆裡」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的一瞬間是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  小…薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不關我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是超能力者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.11,0:07:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總部預知課發來緊急聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊  局長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真來勁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預知的詳情已經弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機率是92%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三十分鐘後將有兩名LV4-5的超能力者…因醉酒而胡鬧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醉鬼的打架啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒勁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過跟普通人的打架不同  可能會給周圍帶來巨大的危害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECM就是為了這種時候而準備的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LV4-5嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人數應該不多的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到達現場上空了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝擊波
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷電衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經有很多人在圍觀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被新聞報導了的話\N會給其他超能力者帶來很大困擾的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在媒體趕到之前制止他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們三個  都準備好了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  隨時可以出動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清香怡人的早晨是火紅的正義
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原野上吹拂的微風是青澀的友情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,融匯的紫色是高貴之心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  Children
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:08:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人越來越多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點把他們抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上囉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動  兩敗俱傷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  趁現在  快點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  逮捕完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  他們不是超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那剛才的騷動是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衣服里安著電線？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有裝置火藥的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一切都是為了把你們特殊任務超能力者引出來的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是普通的圍觀者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我們很普通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且普通人是討厭超能力者的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:10:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是作為其代表誓與你們戰鬥的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是反超能力者組織「平凡人」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.05,0:10:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算憎惡超能力者  也沒必要做到這種地步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們太不正常了  一點都不普通
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  很普通
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這幫傢伙是「平凡人」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要將他們一網打盡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也用不了超能力…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個感覺是剛才的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECM？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠制壓LV7的ECM國內還只有一台…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「平凡人」無處不在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是軍隊的內部也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yororurihi  我是奈津子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(640,660)}よろるりひ、奈津子です。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(640,660)}すご、なぜよ出る。BY ほたる
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害  為什麼用Yo開頭  By 螢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children被扣為人質  飛行員也毫無抵抗地被帶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從剛才起就一直拚命地用精神感應在呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是完全沒有反應
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想透視The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但好像被霧靄覆蓋著的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事  局長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實剛才研究所發來聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型ECM好像被偷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這次的事件就是用了那東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說皆本先生和Children現在都在新型ECM附近吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children要是有個萬一的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會善罷甘休的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:12:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們只是想要B.A.B.E.L所屬的全體超能力者的名單而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是特殊任務超能力者的名單
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為此我們無論如何都需要你頭腦裡的密碼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來你也是個普通人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實你也覺得沒有超能力者的世界比較好對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你願意助我們一臂之力的話  那樣的世界就能實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你就體驗一下我們準備的各式各樣的普通的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的食堂大媽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的靠養老金生活的老人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的上班族和普通的公務員
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有普通的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.97,0:12:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住…住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.41,0:13:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙  居然敢恣意妄為
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個時候不能亂了方寸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要理性地行動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不能刺激對方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輕舉妄動的話  不只是我們和皆本先生\N就連一起被抓的飛行員大叔也會有危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要老實點  等敵人放鬆警惕了自然會有機可乘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些混蛋「平凡人」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  她的理性跟昆蟲一個等級
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這傢伙帶過去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你嚐點苦頭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然對方是小孩  超能力被封住了  任你們胡作非為
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我話說在前頭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子也是很記仇的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們很快就能取回超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也總有一天會長大成人的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你敢動小薰一根頭髮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時候我會讓你後悔活在這個世上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你說什麼  你這臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  我不是說了不要刺激他們的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種心情要掩飾到最後一刻才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  復仇這種料理要冷了才好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到形式逆轉之後\N再拔光他們的毛  好好地蹂躪他們就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  這孩子有點笨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會好好訓斥她的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也是毫不掩飾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  不把那個停下來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去完全無能為力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也真頑強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本光一小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也沒有那麼多閒功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不讓我們費那麼大力氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多該告訴我密碼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆…皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你打算怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想聽她的慘叫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  你們還算是人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  你們太不普通了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想被超能力者說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  我們很普通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們「平凡人」沒把超能力者當作是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是擁有異形能力的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是作為人類的天敵而誕生的新型生物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我更不能告訴你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:16:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者也是有自己的家人和生活的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想踐踏這一切嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想和你爭辯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有三「只」小鬼在這
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄死一「只」也無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要對她動手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,密碼是？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Save The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始就老老實實招供的話就不用吃苦頭了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急模式啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有數據文件轉移刪除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上當了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早料到只要我忍住不說  你們遲早會將三人中的一個帶過來威脅我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來啟動ECCM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECCM？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:16:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  把這幫傢伙打飛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  超能力…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢復了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動隨意門
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力恢復了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECCM是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ESP Counter Counter Measure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是讓ECM無效化的裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓ECM…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECM投入實用的話  就可能會有用它做壞事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們必須要考慮對應手段的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以B.A.B.E.L才會積極地協助ECM的開發
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:17:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點  趁現在去停止ECM
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是緊急用的  電池堅持不了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢給我耍花招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些該死的超能力者和B.A.B.E.L的走狗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是這世界秩序的破壞者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肅清超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要停  繼續射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic Aegis Shield{\r}\N念動無敵之盾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  對她們還是不利  會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你仔細看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王真正的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(556,660)}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是誰  不管是什麼  都無法制止她的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我射  給我射  不停地射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電池快要…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要射了  會打到ECM的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是費了我好大勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們已經完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本——！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能  ECM…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事  這小鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物  真真正正的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要讓皆本所受的苦原倍奉還
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙已經是喪家之犬  他們找不到超越超能力的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會畏懼超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必為了這種人而弄髒自己的雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  沒事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ECM…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西已經不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們來說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總會平息的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是靠武器或者機械的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫做肌肉大鐮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也在專心幹農事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過是在有點高的圍牆裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真能幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見了  少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這聲音是誰的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是第1話出來的肌肉大鐮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管來幾次  我都會把他打倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:23:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第8話  「兵部京介！啊、出來了嗎？」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的女王  快點變成大人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(551.,660)}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.55,0:24:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

